                        "glosses": [
                            "Thundering loudly from high above."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "35cbe2d2-a64e-455c-ac5c-64cdf316fad1",
                                "sense_id": "ff7539d3-e23f-3694-9e72-9f56f127c00f",
                                "text": "And for that he singeth the psalmes in the church with such a jesticulus tone and altitonant voyce, viz.: squeaking like a gelded pigg — which doth not onlie interrupt the other voyces, but is altogether dissonant and disagreeing unto any musicall harmonie, and he hath bene requested by the minister to leave it, but he doth obstinatlie persist and contynue therein."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a8a7cf7-806a-4d0d-a392-fd4bd72c212f",
                                "sense_id": "ff7539d3-e23f-3694-9e72-9f56f127c00f",
                                "text": "Hear, thou altitonant Jove, and Furies three."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "151666e3-8764-40b4-95da-539796db1401",
                                "sense_id": "ff7539d3-e23f-3694-9e72-9f56f127c00f",
                                "text": "Altitonant, Imperial-crown'd, and thunder-armed Jove, Unfold thy fiery veil, the flaming robe And superficies of thy better brightness;"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
